{"chapter": "spaces", "node_kind": "lemma", "parent_tag": "02YT", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$S \\in \\Ob(\\Sch_{fppf})$", "MATH_0002": "$S$", "MATH_0003": "$S$", "SPACE_0001": "\\ ", "SPACE_0002": "\\ "}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{lemma}\n\\label{lemma-base-change-immersions}\n", "suffix": "\\end{lemma}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:75e0bd2a0154ce6e65bd6cb429246b47726475dbd7595f3cce635af1c9c30772", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:c936d2e2eae5d2e8a5b170fe33f27f8d0470f9507f3bf3694d361920c60fa47e", "source_text": "Let <MATH_0001> be a scheme.\nA base change of a (closed, resp.<SPACE_0001>open) immersion\nof algebraic spaces over <MATH_0002> is a (closed, resp.<SPACE_0002>open)\nimmersion of algebraic spaces over <MATH_0003>.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:e08e439eccbf2719074890392c821028bffffcd646cf42b5a2e01a8ae8bcc01b", "unit_id": "tag:02YW:statement"}
